question:
Construct a Gaussian command line for an ONIOM calculation that meets the following computational requirements: 
• Uses a high-level layer computed with an SCF method that incorporates extra polarization functions and a low-level layer computed with a minimal basis; 
• Supports geometry optimization and vibrational frequency calculations; 
• Reads geometry and SCF guess data from a checkpoint file; 
• Disables two-electron integral compression and includes an option to use five d-functions for enhanced precision; and 
• Incorporates a solvation model appropriate for a chloroform environment.
Provide only the Gaussian command.
